WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
Containerization, service virtualization
and contract testing solve

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:07.920
different problems. Containers run
software with repeatable dependencies.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:13.120
Virtual services simulate selected
behavior, such as a provider timeout.

00:00:13.182 --> 00:00:16.800
Contract checks examine agreed
interactions between a consumer

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:21.840
and provider. The capabilities complement
each other and need supported owners.

00:00:21.968 --> 00:00:24.480
None establishes every business invariant

00:00:24.587 --> 00:00:27.520
or removes the need for real
integration and recovery checks.
